   Zhu, ZH (Corresponding Author), Pacific Northwest Natl Lab, Environm Mol Sci Lab, Richland, WA 99354 USA.
   Mei, F (Corresponding Author), Pacific Northwest Natl Lab, Atmospher Sci \& Global Change Div, Richland, WA 99352 USA.
   Li, Ye; Zhou, Yadong; Huang, Ye; He, Erkai; Liu, Min, East China Normal Univ, Minist Educ, Sch Geog Sci, Key Lab Geog Informat Sci, Shanghai 200241, Peoples R China.
